# D-CREATE-REUSE-OVER-PEER-FREED-LINKED-CORPSE-SHUTS-NODE-DOWN, H-L1, on the
# disk-locking transport, where the record was first observed (iwc1).  The
# hypothesis, build (~/src/mxfs-b, srcversion A97F45838280C5F3B4C352C), knob,
# settings, measures and VERDICT RULES are those of
# tests/queues/cr63_linked_defer_ab.queue, written before the first lap of
# either queue; only the configuration (2/disk/caw/direct g2b, test15 test16)
# and the labels differ.  The two queues are judged separately, each by those
# rules, and the record needs both before any disposition.
#
# Bound: fw3's, 1680 s per lap (the H-F13 laps on this workload took 390-490 s).
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_CR63_DEFER=0 NG0_IALLOC_FENCE=0 NG0_PEER_UNLINK=300 NG0_DRAIN_BOUND=0 NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_PUBCLAIM_DELAY_MS=200 NG0_CREATE_PARENT_DELAY_MS=5 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 NG0_IFREE_DRAIN=1 NG0_IFREE_REAP=1 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh crwc1 1 300 2/disk/caw/direct g2b
